# Desktop

- Use **pywebview**, not Tauri or Electron.
- Start FastAPI on `127.0.0.1`; if the preferred port is busy, try through 8010 and load that origin in the window.
- Window ~1400×900, title `FinAlly`, dark background.
- Sidecar must exit when the window closes. Do not leave uvicorn running.
- SQLite path: `FINALLY_DB_PATH` or OS app-data `FinAlly/finally.db`.
- Start/stop scripts wrap the desktop entrypoint — not `docker run`. Keep macOS and Windows scripts; implement macOS first.
- Never expose the API on the LAN (`0.0.0.0`). Never `file://`.
- Graded launch is the window. Browser against the same loopback origin is a dev shortcut only.
